Scope of this license
---------------------

This repository combines parts with different provenance.

1. Dual-boot / recovery source

   The boot manager sketches (ats-mini-recovery-beta, ats-mini-recovery-lite),
   the partition tables, and the flashing/build scripts (for example
   ats-mini-recovery-lite/flash-lite.ps1) are provided under this MIT License.

2. Bootloader binaries (not covered by this MIT License)

   ats-mini-recovery-beta/bootloader.bin and ats-mini-recovery-lite/bootloader.bin
   are modified ESP-IDF builds. ESP-IDF is distributed by Espressif under the
   Apache License 2.0, so these binaries are covered by Apache-2.0, not by this
   MIT License. See NOTICE section 4.1 and LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.

Third-party components
----------------------

Files and materials that carry a different copyright or license notice are not
relicensed under this MIT License. In particular, Rotary.cpp and Rotary.h are
Copyright 2011 Ben Buxton and licensed under GPL-3.0 (see
LICENSES/GPL-3.0.txt). Other third-party components remain subject to their own
license terms; see the NOTICE file and the LICENSES directory.

Firmware binaries
-----------------

Firmware binaries built from this repository combine GPL-3.0 covered code
(Rotary; see the NOTICE file) and, for the bootloaders, Apache-2.0 covered
ESP-IDF code. Distributed firmware binaries are therefore subject to GPL-3.0
(combined work) and Apache-2.0 (bootloaders). Provide the corresponding source
code (this repository at the matching commit/tag) and the applicable license
texts when distributing binaries.
